Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.81,0:00:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,上 上 上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go, go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.52,0:01:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,嫌犯逃入了一间仓库 正在全力追捕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suspect on foot, entering warehouse. In pursuit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.79,0:01:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.49,0:02:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,别动 站在原地 放下武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freeze! Stop right there! Put down the weapon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.54,0:02:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你们现在不能阻止的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't stop it now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.09,0:02:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么都阻止不了 - 趴在地上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nothing can stop it. - On the ground!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.26,0:02:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,趴在地上 扔掉它 马上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the ground. Drop it, right now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.21,0:02:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,哈洛伦 哈洛伦警探\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Halloran. Detective halloran.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.73,0:02:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他17分钟内没赶来这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he's not here in 17 minutes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.39,0:02:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,就有5个人会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}five people are going to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.62,0:02:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,快让哈洛伦过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get halloran here, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.83,0:02:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,哈洛伦在他妈哪呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where the fuck is halloran?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.39,0:02:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,会有人送命的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People are gonna die, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.48,0:02:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他还不知道吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't he know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.79,0:02:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,全部后退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of you, get back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.14,0:02:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哈洛伦 - 埃德加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Halloran! - Edgar!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.58,0:02:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,埃德加 你他妈这是在干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Edgar, what the fuck are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.88,0:02:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你快把遥控器放下 - 我不能这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You put down that remote. - I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.96,0:02:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是干什么用的？- 游戏已经开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's that for? - The games are just getting started.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.14,0:02:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么游戏？- 他的游戏 他的规则\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What game? - His games, his rules.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.80,0:02:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我得选择谁死 他们还是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta choose who dies. Them or me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.30,0:02:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,埃德加 我不想开枪 不代表我不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Edgar, I don't want to shoot you, but I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.15,0:02:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,放下遥控器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop the remote.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.23,0:02:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我瞄准他了 要开枪吗 - 不 不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I got him, should I take it? - No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.71,0:02:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,瞄准遥控器 如果他有任何危险举动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Target the remote. If he moves to trigger it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.59,0:02:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,就打爆它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}blow it to shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.71,0:02:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,没有时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Running out of time!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.88,0:02:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那还有谁？- 埃德加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who else is there? - Edgar!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.72,0:03:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我们这到底是怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell us what's going on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.28,0:03:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,谁在遥控你？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's controlling you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.48,0:03:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我他妈可不想死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not fucking dying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.84,0:03:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,是哪个傻逼往他胸口开枪的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which one of you assholes shot him in the chest?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.35,0:03:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.42,0:03:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,已经开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's started...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.56,0:04:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.72,0:04:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这他妈是怎么回事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell? What the fuck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.00,0:04:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这他妈什么情况？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, what the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.70,0:04:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 妈的 - 天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, shit. - Oh, god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.64,0:04:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.75,0:04:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.38,0:04:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This can't be happening!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.97,0:04:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,来人啊 救命啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone, help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.35,0:04:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.45,0:04:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,救命 谁来救救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help! Somebody please help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.33,0:04:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,救救我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.86,0:04:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,救命 救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help! Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.73,0:04:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,求求你 救救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.19,0:04:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你别他妈过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just stay the fuck back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.10,0:04:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你们现在肯定很诧异\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure you are all wondering{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.75,0:04:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么你们会在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}why you're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.30,0:05:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,毫无疑问 你们都否认自己有罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You deny culpability, no doubt,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.51,0:05:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,相信你们对现下的处境已有所了解 在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the circumstances in which you find yourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.42,0:05:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你们将得到救赎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Salvation can be yours,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.69,0:05:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,前提是你们必须洗心革面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you cleanse yourselves{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.23,0:05:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你们惯于说谎 所以才会有如今的境遇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the habitual lies which have brought you here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.62,0:05:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你们欺骗自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lies that you have told yourselves,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.22,0:05:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,欺骗他人且对其造成了深深的伤害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lies that have brutalized others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.12,0:05:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,忏悔吧 真实的话语能换回你们的自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Confess. The truth will set you free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.59,0:05:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,但任何企图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But any attempt{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.05,0:05:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,违反我的规则的人 都会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to violate my rules will kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.40,0:05:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我想玩个游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to play a game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.78,0:05:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,去你妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.97,0:05:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,首先 血之献祭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First, an offering of blood,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.35,0:05:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,无论献祭血量多少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no matter how little,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.99,0:05:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,头套上的灯会变成绿色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will give you a green light{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.35,0:05:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,只有这样才能活着逃离这个房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to escape from this room with your lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.86,0:05:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你们把真实的自己从心魔中释放出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you can release yourself from your demons,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.93,0:05:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你们才可以除掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you can begin to shed the chains{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.95,0:05:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,心魔附在你们身上的铁链\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that those demons bring with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.27,0:05:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,遵循我规则去做血之献祭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make the simple blood sacrifice that I've requested,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.79,0:05:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,或者面对严重的后果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or face severe consequences.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.61,0:05:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你们自己选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The choice is yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.51,0:06:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这他妈到底是怎么回事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fuck is going on over here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.68,0:06:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 不 不… - 不 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, no, no... - No, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.50,0:06:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.68,0:06:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.60,0:06:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办？该怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do we do? What do we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.79,0:06:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,谁有办法啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone do something!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.89,0:06:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 快醒醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Wake up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.10,0:06:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,快醒醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wake up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.17,0:06:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,"血之献祭"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"An offering of blood..."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.68,0:06:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,"无论血量多少"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"No matter how little..."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.72,0:07:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,"血之献祭…"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"An offering of blood..."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.48,0:07:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,割伤自己 你们得割伤自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut yourself! You need to cut yourself!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.64,0:07:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,给他血 我们就自由了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants blood and then you're free!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.15,0:07:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,割伤自己 他要的是血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut yourself, he wants blood!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.38,0:07:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,快割伤自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut yourself!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.50,0:07:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,操\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.87,0:07:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 就割一小下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.94,0:07:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 终于解脱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes! Holy shit...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.32,0:07:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你得割伤自己…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to cut yourself!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.83,0:08:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这他妈…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.33,0:08:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.74,0:08:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,割伤自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut yourself!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.99,0:08:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你得割伤你自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to cut yourself!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.25,0:08:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,快割伤自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut yourself!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.05,0:08:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这他妈是在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where the fuck are we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.82,0:08:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他按了遥控器 却没见任何东西被启动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He hit the remote, but nothing triggered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.09,0:08:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,就目前我们的了解来看 是没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As far as we know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.16,0:08:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得他说的游戏是真的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think the game's real?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.67,0:08:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.03,0:08:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他要求你到现场这事 你怎么看？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And why do you think he asked for you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.89,0:08:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是老熟人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're good friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.33,0:08:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我两次把他送进监狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I put him away twice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.91,0:08:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,埃德加·曼森是个反社会的瘾君子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Edgar munsen is a sociopathic meth head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.05,0:08:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,因故意伤人 持械抢劫 毒品交易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Been in and out of prison for assault and battery,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.78,0:08:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,成了监狱的常客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}armed robbery, drug dealing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.00,0:09:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,极品吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.56,0:09:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,医生 把他叫醒吧 我们有问题问他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, we need him awake. We've got questions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.37,0:09:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 警探\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, detective.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.61,0:09:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,子弹就离心脏差一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bullet's lodged against the heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.39,0:09:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我用巴比妥使他进入昏迷状态 直到他病情稳定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got him in a barbiturate-induced coma until he stabilizes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.15,0:09:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 要多久？- 他得先消肿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How long? - Swelling has to come down first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.67,0:09:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,两个小时 两个星期 我可说不准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two hours. Two weeks. I can't tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.09,0:09:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,失陪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.36,0:09:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,列个嫌疑人名单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Start the suspect list{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.49,0:09:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,从曼森的同伙们着手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with munsen's known associates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.48,0:09:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,看来这事情没那么简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not gonna end well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.54,0:09:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,饿吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hungry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.04,0:09:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.55,0:09:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,来人啊 救命啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, somebody help us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.99,0:09:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.57,0:09:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,来人啊 别碰…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please! Don't...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.70,0:09:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,别乱动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay still.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.55,0:09:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你想我们怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want with us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.70,0:09:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那段录音…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That voice...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.29,0:09:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,提到了我们可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It said salvation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.86,0:09:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,得到救赎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can be ours if we,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.33,0:09:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,只要我们洗心革面 因说谎而忏悔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}cleanse our soul of our lies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.44,0:10:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这算是个狗屁告解室吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is some kind of fucked up confessional?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.84,0:10:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,真实的话语会让我们自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The truth will set us free.{\r}
