Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.16,0:10:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Anna.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.46,0:10:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,而你刚才说的都是屁话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, bullshit.{\r}
