Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.14,0:10:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,卡莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.20,0:10:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,别碰我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't touch me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.47,0:10:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这是哪个变态开的混账玩笑？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is some bastard's sick idea of a joke?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.65,0:10:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,他说这是个游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said it was a game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.03,0:10:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,对我们来说 要真是游戏就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then I hope, for all of our sakes, that it is a game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.74,0:10:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗？为什么这么说 甜心？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah? Why's that, sweetheart?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.93,0:10:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,因为游戏是可以赢的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because games can be won.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.86,0:10:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这可真疯狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is cray{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.73,0:11:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.05,0:11:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有人报警了吗？- 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did anyone phone the police? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.19,0:11:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,下手投掷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Underhand!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.51,0:11:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,过肩投掷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Overhand!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.47,0:11:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊 你状态不错啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, you got some heat on it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.37,0:11:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我关机是有原因的 哈洛伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cell phone's off for a reason, halloran.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.60,0:11:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,埃尔 你怎么看？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, what do you think, El?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.29,0:11:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 他看上去有点苍白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, he looks a little pale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.69,0:11:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,把这东西拿下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get this thing off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.80,0:12:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,有人在效仿约翰·克莱默\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone's been studying up on John Kramer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.25,0:12:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,是个模仿型罪犯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A copycat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.15,0:12:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,最好不是 克莱默都死了10年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hope not. Kramer's been dead for 10 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.17,0:12:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 基思 - 你好吗 医生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Keith! - What's up, doc?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.31,0:12:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 哥们 你还好吗？- 我很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, man, how you doing? - I'm good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.67,0:12:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 很高兴见到你 - 我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good to see you. - You too, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.13,0:12:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在来这儿工作了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're, uh... You're working this neighborhood now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.27,0:12:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 上个月我刚调到凶杀科\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, yeah, I joined homicide last month.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.12,0:12:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,老天爷啊 这家伙经历了什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus, what happened to this guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.26,0:12:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你们俩认识？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You two know each other?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.66,0:12:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,洛根是我们在费卢杰的医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logan was our medic in fallujah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.63,0:12:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 我对克里斯汀的遭遇深感遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, uh, I'm sorry to hear about Christine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.51,0:12:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吧 伙计？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you been, man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.30,0:12:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,还好 基思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, good, Keith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.09,0:12:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我调整得很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'm doing well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.87,0:12:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.91,0:12:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,埃莉诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eleanor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.79,0:12:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.92,0:13:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,切开看看吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.16,0:13:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,"还有四个"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"And then there were four..."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.49,0:13:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你这有电脑能插这U盘吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got a computer we could stick that in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.84,0:13:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,游戏又开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The games have begun again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.26,0:13:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦开始就不会结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they will not stop{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.27,0:13:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,直到赎完所有的罪过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until the sins against the innocent are atoned for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.46,0:13:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来的四个目标由我来负责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will take care of the next four,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.43,0:13:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,其余的都归你管了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you take care of the rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.09,0:13:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得把这录音拿去做声音识别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta get that to voice rec.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.28,0:14:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这声音不是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.35,0:14:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能是他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can't be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.38,0:14:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,对吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.42,0:14:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.62,0:14:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这他妈是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.87,0:14:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这他妈是什么情况？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.50,0:14:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这一点都不吓人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, that's not creepy at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.31,0:15:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.18,0:15:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.43,0:15:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.05,0:15:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,谁来救救我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody please help us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.51,0:15:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这个变态要把我们拉到哪去？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is this sick fuck taking us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.29,0:15:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你们有看到过什么吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did anyone see anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.85,0:15:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,什么也没看到 我他妈被人下药了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, nothing. I got fucking drugged!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.89,0:15:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他说"忏悔"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said, "confess."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.59,0:15:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须忏悔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to confess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.94,0:15:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗 你有什么想忏悔的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you got something you want to confess?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.43,0:15:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,开始啊 说啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have at it. Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.91,0:15:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的 我们都有要忏悔的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it, we all have something to confess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.49,0:15:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾经卖了一辆摩托车给一个小孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sold a kid a bike once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.76,0:15:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他买走摩托 10分钟后他就出事故了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had an accident 10 minutes after I sold it to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.90,0:15:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,他驾驭不了马力这么强的摩托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not my fault he couldn't handle{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.24,0:15:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,可这不是我的错 对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}such a powerful damn bike, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.86,0:15:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他死了 - 就这样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He died! - That's it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.30,0:15:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你只干了这事？你卖了辆摩托 那小孩出车祸死了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's all you did? You sold a kid a bike he died on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.06,0:15:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 行了 伙计 - 就这事 没别的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, man! - That's it! I said that's it, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.15,0:15:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你别扯淡了 那你呢 亲爱的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, bullshit. And what about you, sweetheart?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.79,0:15:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.11,0:15:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的孩子死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We lost our baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.86,0:16:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,安娜…安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anna... Anna.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.94,0:16:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我这都不是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me that this isn't happening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.55,0:16:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我丈夫犯了个错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My husband made a mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.62,0:16:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不 这算不上什么忏悔 继续 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. That's not a confession, come on. Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.85,0:16:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 说啊 - 我不知道你他妈的想让我说什么 好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on! - I don't know what the fuck you want me to say, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.48,0:16:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是我导致我们的婚姻破碎 - 不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I let our marriage fall apart. - No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.63,0:16:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,"我在塔尔萨杀了一个妓女"这才算是忏悔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A confession is, "i killed a hooker in Tulsa",{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.34,0:16:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,或者"我他妈吃了我邻居"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or, "i ate my fucking neighbor."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.51,0:16:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不是"我需要婚姻咨询"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not, "i need marriage counseling."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.02,0:16:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 卡莉 你呢？- 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Carly? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.62,0:16:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我什么都想不起来 - 好吧 那快点想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nothing I can think of. - Yeah, well, think faster!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.24,0:16:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,还是你自己快点想吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think faster!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.56,0:16:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.70,0:16:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要被吊死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going to hang.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.31,0:16:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,快点放那个录音带 米奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Play the damn tape, Mitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.30,0:16:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, god!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.26,0:17:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你们都想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}While I am certain that there is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.49,0:17:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,因为之前的血之献祭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a desire to point fingers at me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.97,0:17:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,而来指责我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the blood that has been shed,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.80,0:17:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,但除非你们先指责自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}unless you turn that finger inward,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.58,0:17:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,否则我保证你们会流更多的血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I assure you, more blood will be lost{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.07,0:17:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,而且所有人都面临审判\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and all will be judged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.67,0:17:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们先从你们其中之一开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will begin with one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.18,0:17:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这位不只是个骗子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One who is not only a liar,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.69,0:17:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还是个贼 - 嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- but a thief. - Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.09,0:17:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,一个抢包的贼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A purse-snatcher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.81,0:17:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,但当你有机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when you had a chance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.30,0:17:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,去弥补你造成的伤害时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to fix the harm that you'd done,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.06,0:17:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你却选择袖手旁观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you chose to do nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.35,0:17:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你可能会因为没有得到有效的治疗而死去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now it is you who could die without the right medication.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.25,0:17:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,在你们都处于昏迷状态时 你们当中的这个骗子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}While unconscious, this deceiver among you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.00,0:17:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这个罪人被注射了毒药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this criminal, was injected with a poison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.88,0:17:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你们面前的这几个注射器中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of the syringes in front of you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.21,0:17:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,有一个装着解药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}holds the antidote.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.11,0:17:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,一个装着盐水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One is a saline solution,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.76,0:17:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,另一个注射器里装的都是令人死状极惨的酸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the other, an acid that will cause an excruciating death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.48,0:18:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,如果注射了正确的药 你们的锁链都将被解开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inject the correct one and your chains will be released.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.72,0:18:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,如果没有选对药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Failure to make the right choice{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.31,0:18:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,会导致你们全体死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}could result in death for you all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.61,0:18:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我问你们 对你们来说 一条命值多少钱？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ask you, what is a life worth to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.82,0:18:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,是谁 赶紧坦白吧 要不我们都得死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of you 'fess up, or we all die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.84,0:18:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好吧 检查自己身上是不是有痕迹 - 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay, check yourself for marks. - Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.78,0:18:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他给我们注射了 会留下痕迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he injected us, there could be marks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.64,0:18:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,就是你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bingo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.09,0:18:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在干什么？- 没事的 没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you doing? - It's okay, it's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.36,0:18:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你只需要选一个注射器 美女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just got to pick a needle, blondie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.42,0:18:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 只要你选对了解药 我们就能拿掉这些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, we get out of these things when you pick an antidote.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.69,0:18:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不然我们都会死 卡莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or else we all die, Carly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.27,0:18:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 万一是酸呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. What if it's the acid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.68,0:18:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不选 - 你不选个屁啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I won't. - Bullshit, you won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.33,0:19:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,或许只需你忏悔呢 卡莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe just confess, Carly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.46,0:19:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧 你是偷包的贼吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, did you steal purses?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.11,0:19:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,是 几年前了 但是我没杀死任何人啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, years ago, but I didn't kill anyone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.75,0:19:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 这可不是那家伙想要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no! No, that's not the repentant attitude{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.70,0:19:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,忏悔的态度 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this guy's looking for, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.02,0:19:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你撒谎 你撒谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're lying. You're lying!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.67,0:19:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我当时身无分文 好吗？没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! I was broke, okay? And yes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.59,0:19:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是有人死了 但那不是我的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}somebody died, but it wasn't my fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.04,0:19:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.00,0:19:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 赶紧选 否则我把这三支都扎到你身上 - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Choose, or I'm gonna stick them all into you! - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.75,0:19:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哥们 冷静 - 你是在开玩笑吗？住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yo, man! - Are you kidding me? Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.12,0:19:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,先让她看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just let her look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.28,0:19:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这些数字哪个对你来说有实际意义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do any of these numbers mean anything to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.43,0:19:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 现在就选 - 我在努力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Choose now! - I'm trying!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.15,0:19:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,3.53美元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}$3.53.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.27,0:19:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？这数字什么意思？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? What does that mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.19,0:19:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 一条命对我来说值多少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - What a life is worth to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.24,0:19:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我操\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, fuck...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.79,0:19:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就选 来啊 选一支\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Choose, right now! Come on, pick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.53,0:20:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 选一支 现在就选 - 求你了 我真选不出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Pick one! Pick now! - Please! I can't do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.21,0:20:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 赶紧选一支啊 - 要不我们都会死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Pick one now! - We're all going to die!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.88,0:20:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快选 - 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Pick now! - Come on.{\r}
