Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.94,0:34:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞安 解放自己 才能解救他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ryan, free yourself to free them.{\r}
