Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.00,0:34:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞安 我们要被活埋了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ryan, man, we're going to get buried alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.12,0:34:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ryan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.72,0:34:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ryan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.69,0:34:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ryan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.72,0:34:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,快去拉操作杆 瑞安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get to the handle! Ryan!{\r}
