Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.88,0:35:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须这样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.25,0:35:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,快去拉操作杆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get to the handle!{\r}
