Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.84,0:35:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.02,0:35:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你有什么故事 亲爱的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your story, sweetheart?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.81,0:35:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你想问我什么 警探？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you asking, detective?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.25,0:35:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是那种喜欢重口味的 是吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You one of those, uh, kinky types?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.46,0:35:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 喜欢疼痛的感觉？- 为什么这么说？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Like a little pain? - Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.38,0:35:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你想被惩罚吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to get punished?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.13,0:35:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,太晚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.29,0:35:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经有个天天折磨我的前妻了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Already got an ex-wife that tortures me every day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.26,0:35:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 也许你活该 - 大概是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maybe you deserve it. - Probably.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.02,0:35:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,马尔科姆·尼尔被杀那晚你在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where were you the night Malcolm neale got murdered?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.56,0:35:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,家里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.63,0:35:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 独自一人 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Alone. - Cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.01,0:35:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,对了 你能证明吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. Can you prove that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.27,0:36:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要证明吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I need to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.38,0:36:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 早点回家来 爸爸 - 我会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come home soon, daddy. - I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.37,0:36:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉又让你等到这么晚 朱迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry you have to stay so late again, Judy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.91,0:36:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这你就别操心啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.39,0:36:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 睡个好觉 梅尔 我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, sleep sweet, Mel. I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.47,0:36:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我也爱你老爸 - 爱你 拜拜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Love you too, daddy. - Love you, bye.{\r}
