Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.10,0:36:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,洛根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.58,0:36:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你在哪找到埃莉诺的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you find Eleanor?{\r}
