Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.62,0:36:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,她只是你的助手吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that all she is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.91,0:36:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,克里斯汀过世两年了 真的是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been two years since Christine passed. It's just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.20,0:36:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会怪你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't blame you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.31,0:36:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 但是我是专业的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, but I'm a professional.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.00,0:36:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,洛根 你有没有听说过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, Logan, you ever heard{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.45,0:36:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,一个叫"竖锯游戏规则"的网站？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of a website called "Jigsaw rules"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.13,0:36:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 在网络里藏的很深\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - Buried deep online.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.33,0:36:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,做了些调查 但这是个致力于竖锯游戏的网站\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Took some digging, but it's a site devoted to Jigsaw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.67,0:36:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,一半的内容都是些装腔作势的人在胡扯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Half of it's bullshit, posers,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.68,0:36:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,但是网站里确实有不少令人不安的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but there's some stuff on there that is really messed up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.98,0:36:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 网站上有很多变态 - 那又怎么样呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A lot of sick fucks. - Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.48,0:36:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们做了暗网IP地址排查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We did a darknet ip trawl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.11,0:36:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你的助手没少光顾这个网站\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got a lot of hits from your assistant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.55,0:36:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,她是网站的常客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's a regular.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.60,0:37:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,下载了很多你无法想象的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Downloaded some shit you cannot imagine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.12,0:37:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 你是说埃莉诺·邦尼维尔就是我们要找的模仿犯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you're saying that Eleanor bonneville is our copycat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.79,0:37:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我们不是这个意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, that's not what we're saying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.63,0:37:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你查过她的不在场证明了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you check her alibi?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.09,0:37:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,她说铁桶男尸被发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, she said she was home{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.16,0:37:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,吊在公园里的那天早上 她在家里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the morning that buckethead was found hanging in the park.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.68,0:37:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,早上七点？独自在家？单身女性？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At 7:00 A.M.? Home alone? A single woman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.69,0:37:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 确实有点可疑 - 好的 那我们回到刚才的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That does sound suspicious. - All right, let's rewind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.73,0:37:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,埃莉诺是怎么找上你的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did Eleanor come to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.28,0:37:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,她找到这个部门来完成实习\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She sought out the department to do her residency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.69,0:37:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,之后呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And after that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.19,0:37:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,她实习结束后呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After she finished her residency?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.06,0:37:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 三个月前 有份工作想签她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, three months ago, she was offered a job{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.27,0:37:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,去克利夫兰市太平间从事尸检工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}running the show at the Cleveland city morgue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.43,0:37:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么她没选择去那工作？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why didn't she take that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.94,0:37:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你会想搬到克利夫兰吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you want to move to Cleveland?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.78,0:37:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,实验室来的电话 结果出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the lab. Results are in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.34,0:37:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这个是在受害人马尔科姆·尼尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, so this is the DNA of the blood{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.23,0:37:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,指甲内血迹里的DNA\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}scraped from under the fingernails of the first victim, Malcolm neale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.50,0:37:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,对 铁桶男尸 能确认身份了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, buckethead. Can you ID it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.76,0:37:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,已经确认了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Already did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.61,0:37:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这是十年前一个罪犯的血液样本\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a blood sample from a perp taken a decade ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.22,0:38:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该还记得那个案子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You might remember the case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.43,0:38:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,完全吻合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an exact match.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.12,0:38:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,是谁的血？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whose blood is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.18,0:38:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰·克莱默的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John Kramer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.47,0:38:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.41,0:38:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.10,0:38:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这是事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a fact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.66,0:38:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我们第一个受害人指甲里的血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The blood under the fingernails of our first victim{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.76,0:38:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,是约翰·克莱默的血？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is John Kramer's blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.46,0:38:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那个竖锯杀人狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Jigsaw killer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.74,0:38:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ryan!{\r}
