Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.16,0:38:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 瑞安 - 救命啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ryan! - Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.72,0:38:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,快去拉操作杆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull the lever!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.82,0:38:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ryan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.89,0:38:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,快去拉操作杆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get to the handle!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.44,0:38:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ryan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.76,0:38:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,救命啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.69,0:38:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ryan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.07,0:38:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.44,0:38:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,去死吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to hell!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.19,0:38:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你得帮帮我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta help us out, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.32,0:39:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,救命啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.04,0:39:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,该死 该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, fuck. Oh, fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.86,0:39:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ryan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.68,0:39:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 去拉操作杆 瑞安 - 瑞安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Pull the handle, Ryan! - Ryan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.28,0:39:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,去拉啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.65,0:39:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ryan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.05,0:39:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ryan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.36,0:39:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我们快死在这了 求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna die in here! Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.50,0:39:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,看着上帝的份上 快拉啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the love of god, just pull it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.71,0:39:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们死了 你也活不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we die, you die!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.26,0:39:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝啊…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.60,0:40:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,快关上 上帝啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn it off. Oh, god...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.04,0:40:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这是博纳维尔女士手机的GPS定位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's the GPS location on Ms. bonneville's cell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.57,0:40:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.12,0:40:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,竖锯死了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is Jigsaw dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.32,0:40:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱默死了吗 我们有证据吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did Kramer die, or do we have proof?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.17,0:40:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你要对所有惊慌失措的市民说些什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you have to say to all the panicked citizens{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.79,0:40:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,谁想要答案？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who want answers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.16,0:41:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你关机了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turned your phone off?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.67,0:41:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,可你还是来了 你找到了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And yet here you are, you found me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.26,0:41:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你当警探的话会很出色的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd make a good detective.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.15,0:41:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,也许是我这个人太容易被猜透了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or maybe I'm just too predictable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.72,0:41:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,猜透？不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Predictable? No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.07,0:41:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,哈洛伦起疑心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Halloran's passing the blame around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.43,0:41:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他盯上我们俩了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's looking at us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.12,0:41:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.81,0:41:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他们派人监视我家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're watching my house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.15,0:41:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他觉得你的不在场证明是胡扯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because he thinks your alibi is shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.46,0:41:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你好像挺喜欢那家伙的啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really love that guy, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.25,0:41:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,在郡里工作的第一年 一个很简单的案子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First year at county, clean case,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.06,0:41:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,一个叫阿利斯泰尔·舒尔茨的罪犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a predator by the name of alistair Schultz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.40,0:41:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,在被拘留的时候 哈洛伦把他给揍了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Halloran roughed him up while he was in custody{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.15,0:41:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,律师利用了这一点帮他脱罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the lawyer used that to get him off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.75,0:41:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,放出来的第二天 他就杀了一个8岁的女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The very next day, he kills an 8-year-old girl{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.73,0:41:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,那女孩的尸检是我做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who shows up on my table.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.37,0:41:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,她是第一个受害者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The first of many.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.65,0:42:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,哈洛伦自控能力很差\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Halloran can't help himself,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.10,0:42:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,总是控制不住自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can't get out of his own way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.12,0:42:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 不 我并不喜欢那个家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, no, I don't have much love for the guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.70,0:42:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,但这是工作 洛根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's a job, Logan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.43,0:42:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能夹杂私人感情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't make it personal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.12,0:42:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,等你也有个小女儿时…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you have a little girl one day...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.90,0:42:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么不告诉我克利夫兰那份工作的事情？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why didn't you tell me about the job offer in Cleveland?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.37,0:42:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 因为你肯定会让我接受 - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Because you would have told me to take it. - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.15,0:42:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没错 我当然会让你接受 - 这很复杂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, you're damn right i would. - It's complicated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.90,0:42:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,再复杂的事情我们都经历过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are past complicated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.77,0:42:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,铁桶头死的那晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When buckethead was strung up,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.01,0:42:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我并不在家 我对警察撒谎了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wasn't at home like I told the cops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.09,0:42:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我在自己的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was at my, uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.08,0:42:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,工作室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Studio.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.38,0:42:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,什么工作室？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What studio?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.08,0:42:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 为什么你不和他们说实话？- 正如我说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And why couldn't you tell them that? - Like I said,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.55,0:42:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这…这件事很复杂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's... it's complicated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.97,0:42:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你认为他们会查不出来吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't think they're going to find out about it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.82,0:42:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他们知道竖锯的粉丝网站\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They know about the Jigsaw fan website,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.84,0:42:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你们他妈的在上面干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whatever the fuck you're doing on that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.57,0:43:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都会一清二楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're going to find out about everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.87,0:43:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,埃莉诺 他们认为我也参与其中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}El, they think I'm involved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.47,0:43:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,带我去看看吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.37,0:44:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 我应该提醒你 因为…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Jesus! Okay, I should warn you, because...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.13,0:44:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你能把灯打开吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you turn the lights on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.92,0:44:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,埃莉诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eleanor,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.00,0:44:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.83,0:44:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 女孩也得有自己的爱好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, a girl's gotta have a hobby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.28,0:44:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,爱好？你管这个叫爱好？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A hobby? Is that what you call it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.32,0:44:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么不去集邮？那才叫爱好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about a stamp collection? That's a hobby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.34,0:45:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,很漂亮 不是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's beautiful, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.15,0:45:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,据说 这个机关是约翰·克莱默\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Supposedly, John Kramer designed this trap{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.38,0:45:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,在其他那些人之前设计的一个游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for a game that took place before all the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.88,0:45:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在他的实验室里发现了设计稿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They found the plans in his lab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.61,0:45:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我亲手做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I built it myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.47,0:45:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我从是网上的某些家伙那儿弄到的设计稿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got them from some guy on the Internet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.63,0:45:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,传言说 约翰不仅仅设计了它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rumor is, not only did John design this,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.25,0:45:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他还造了一个实物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he built one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.67,0:45:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 要让你失望了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm sorry to disappoint,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.94,0:45:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,但是克莱默的受害者中 没有人死于这样的机关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but none of Kramer's victims died in any device like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.38,0:45:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,伤口和这个机关都不相符\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The wounds don't match the design.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.08,0:45:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是尸体一直还没被发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, maybe the bodies were never found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.02,0:46:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,也可能这个游戏从未进行过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And maybe it never happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.98,0:46:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是有人在耍你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe someone's playing games with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.61,0:46:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你搞这些东西干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing with all this stuff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.76,0:46:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在得放弃这种爱好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to get rid of it, now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.47,0:47:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,干得漂亮 现在我们有正当的理由了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great work. Now we've got probable cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.77,0:47:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你绝对不会相信的 - 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're not going to believe this. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.57,0:47:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,特派员想看看竖锯的遗体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The commissioner wants to see Jigsaw's remains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.09,0:47:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,想证明他真的死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wants proof he's really dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.85,0:47:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.33,0:47:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他说想平息民众的恐惧 - 你认真的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Said he wants to calm the peoples' fears. - Are you serious?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.46,0:47:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,追查一个死人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chasing a dead man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.62,0:47:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这都是选举年的狗屁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is election year bullshit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.93,0:47:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这件事交给你了 我还要处理这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is all yours. I'm going to follow up on these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.56,0:47:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.02,0:48:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,哈洛伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Halloran.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.56,0:48:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他在昏迷中 怎么可能会消失？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's in a fucking coma, how does he just disappear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.74,0:48:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他还有呼吸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's still breathing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.16,0:48:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.33,0:48:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,上面有我的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It says my name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.59,0:48:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道 如果我们违反规则会发生什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what happens if we don't follow the rules.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.03,0:49:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 米奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Mitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.48,0:49:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经承认你曾把一辆摩托车卖给一个男孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've admitted to selling a boy a motorcycle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.15,0:49:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,但你并没有说出全部实情 对吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you have not told the entire story, have you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.32,0:49:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你给这辆600美元的摩托车 列了一张漂亮的性能表\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}$600 for a bike that you listed in excellent condition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.87,0:49:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,即使你明知刹车是坏的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even though you knew the brakes were faulty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.51,0:49:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你拿了他的600美元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You took his 600 bucks{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.54,0:49:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,做为回报 你将他推向了死路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and, in return, you delivered him to his end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.56,0:49:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他是我的侄子 他从来没伤害过任何人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was my nephew, and he never hurt anyone.{\r}
