Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.82,0:49:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,和你卖给我侄子的那辆摩托车的引擎一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the same engine that graced the bike you sold my nephew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.14,0:49:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我操\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.96,0:49:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 我向你保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However, I assure you,{\r}
