Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.97,0:50:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,拉下操作杆 摩托车就能停下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hit the motorcycle brake handle and the motor will stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.67,0:50:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我操 - 是生还是死 米奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, shit. - Live or die, Mitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.31,0:50:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,由你来选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The choice is yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.46,0:50:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,该死 不 不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit! No, no, no!{\r}
