Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.53,0:50:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我错了 快停下 拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'm sorry! Stop, please!{\r}
