Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.47,0:50:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 快啊 拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry up! Hurry, please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.16,0:50:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托救救我 快点 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please help! Hurry! Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.31,0:51:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想死 我不想死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to die! I don't want to die!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.67,0:51:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,米奇 拉那个操作杆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mitch, pull the brake!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.31,0:51:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,拉那个操作杆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull the brake!{\r}
