Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.23,0:51:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,安娜…安娜 求你快我救出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anna... Anna, get me out of here, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.32,0:51:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你做到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.83,0:51:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你做到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, you did it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.76,0:51:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no!{\r}
