Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.63,0:52:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你就这么一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got one job!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.39,0:52:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,只有这一件事要做 你个没用的混…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One job to do, you useless mother...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.03,0:52:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.70,0:52:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么线索吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything?{\r}
