Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.69,0:52:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 申请逮捕博纳维尔 我们在那见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, get a warrant for Bonneville, I'll see you there.{\r}
