Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.37,0:54:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你得相信… - 你知不知道她在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You just have to trust... - Do you know where she is or not?{\r}
