Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.59,0:55:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哈洛伦 - 他有动机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Halloran. - He had motive.{\r}
