Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.75,0:55:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,是谁下令瞄准遥控器的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who ordered the targeting of the remote?{\r}
