Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.73,0:55:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,哈洛伦瞄准的是哪里吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what halloran was aiming at?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.86,0:55:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,他根本没打算让埃德加活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had no plan to let Edgar walk.{\r}
