Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.70,0:55:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.57,0:55:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗 在这些事之前 我就盯上哈洛伦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I've been onto halloran since before all of this started.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.64,0:55:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,内务部把他和过去几年的多起凶杀案联系在了一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}IA has him connected to multiple homicides going back years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.12,0:55:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,现在最新的竖锯谋杀案…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now these latest Jigsaw murders...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.08,0:55:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,之前我们带给你的三具尸体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The three bodies we brought you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.73,0:55:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们发现都和哈洛伦的案子有关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we found they're all mixed up in halloran's cases.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.86,0:56:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,把他抓起来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring him in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.43,0:56:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,哈洛伦想要嫁祸给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Halloran is trying to frame me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.89,0:56:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我都不知道他凭什么针对我 - 是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't even know what he's got against me. - Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.46,0:56:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道你说过他搞砸了很多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know you called him out for screwing up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.79,0:56:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,十拿九稳的案子吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}slam-dunk cases.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.34,0:56:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,还在媒体前说他是个白痴 两次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said he was a moron in the press. Twice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.87,0:56:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我是说他是个冲动的混蛋…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I said he was an impulsive asshole...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.75,0:56:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,两次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.80,0:56:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你还把克里斯汀的死算在他头上 不是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You blame him for what happened to Christine, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.38,0:56:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我不知道该怎么证明哈洛伦是竖锯的模仿者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I don't know how to prove Halloran's the copycat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.18,0:56:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,是哈洛伦 就是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's halloran. It's him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.82,0:56:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,让我帮你理清楚案子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me help you build your case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.33,0:56:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,让我来帮你搜集证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me get you proof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.53,0:56:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,让我去解剖埃德加·曼森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me open up Edgar Munsen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.21,0:56:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们把子弹和哈洛伦的枪做一下匹配\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We match that slug to halloran's gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.47,0:56:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你用什么型号的手枪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of firearm do you use?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.08,0:56:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,格洛克22\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Glock 22.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.21,0:56:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,大多数警察都用 除了哈洛伦 他用的17\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most cops do. Except halloran. He's got a 17.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.26,0:56:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,9x19毫米巴拉贝鲁姆子弹 是格洛克17的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}9x19 parabellum. That's a glock 17.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.36,0:56:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.21,0:57:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我送你回家 你就待在家里等我电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take you home. You stay there until I call you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.02,0:57:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我去抓哈洛伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get halloran.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.67,0:57:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,埃尔 你到底在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}El, where the hell are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.16,0:57:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,打给我 有急事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call me, it's urgent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.84,0:57:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.57,0:57:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,埃尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}El!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.37,0:57:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直在给你打电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been trying to call you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.66,0:57:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不知道那具尸体是怎么… - 不 不 不 没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't know how that body got... - No, no, no. It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.81,0:57:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,他们并没有怀疑你和我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They don't think it's you or me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.65,0:57:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的注意力放在哈洛伦身上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have their sights set on halloran.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.43,0:57:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.94,0:57:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我知道游戏是在哪里进行的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I know where the game is being played.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.35,0:57:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,是一个农场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found the farm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.08,0:57:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 太好了 赶紧打给警察 - 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's great, let's call a detective. - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.54,0:57:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,哈洛伦是幕后黑手 我们不能信任这些警察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Halloran's behind this. We can't trust the cops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.27,0:57:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.36,0:57:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你想自己去看看这个游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to see this game for yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.66,0:57:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你迷上这种东西了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get off on this shit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.60,0:57:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,洛根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logan,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.37,0:57:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有机会拯救他们的性命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this is a chance for us to save lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.71,0:57:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们怎么对付一个连环杀人魔？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, we're going take on a serial killer with what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.05,0:57:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,用我们聪明的脑袋？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our cunning intellects?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.03,0:58:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,还有这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.49,0:58:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anna!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.96,0:58:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,别丢下我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't leave me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.20,0:58:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,安娜？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anna?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.47,0:58:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,安娜 我在流血 安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anna,I'm bleeding out, Anna.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.22,0:58:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Motherfucker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.95,0:58:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anna!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.53,0:58:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,好了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.01,0:58:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anna!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.62,0:58:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,别丢下我 求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't leave me, please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.46,0:59:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Anna.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.50,1:00:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.03,1:00:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰·克莱默？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John Kramer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.71,1:00:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,发生什么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.65,1:00:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你们要玩一个游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're about to play a game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.72,1:00:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.07,1:00:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你在干什么 约翰？你在干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. What are you doing, John? What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.55,1:00:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这是终极测试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a final test.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.22,1:00:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经通过你的测试了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I already passed your test!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.60,1:00:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,看看我的腿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at my fucking leg!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.56,1:00:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是你的测试 瑞安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That wasn't your test, Ryan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.11,1:00:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你遵守游戏规则\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that wouldn't have been necessary{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.87,1:00:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,也不会变成现在这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you'd simply played by the rules.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.65,1:00:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,但你一直都不喜欢遵守规则 是吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you don't like rules, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.92,1:00:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要我仁慈一点？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want me to show mercy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.91,1:00:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你从未有过一点点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, who hasn't taken even a single step{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.84,1:00:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,真正的忏悔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}toward confessing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.83,1:00:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你不只是要对一个人的死负责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, who is responsible not for one death,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.51,1:00:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,而是三个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but for three?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.31,1:00:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你从高中开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your life of reckless deceit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.96,1:01:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,就肆无忌惮的欺骗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}started in high school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.92,1:01:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,并且越来越糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And only grew worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.30,1:01:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,坐下 他妈的坐下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit down! Sit the fuck down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.81,1:01:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,他妈的放开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the fuck off me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.88,1:01:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你无数次的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lied to the authorities{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.22,1:01:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,欺骗警察 瑞安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}multiple times, Ryan,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.75,1:01:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,把所有责任都推到司机身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}pinning the blame solely on the driver,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.38,1:01:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是你死去的好友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your deceased best friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.81,1:01:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道你对这个家庭做了什么吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know what you did to his family? Hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.86,1:01:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,之后的几年你依然不知悔改\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you've only gotten worse over the years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.74,1:01:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,是我干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.95,1:01:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 是他妈我干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I fucking did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.63,1:01:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,是我干的 但这是很久以前的事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did it, but it was so long ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.02,1:01:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我想活下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.71,1:01:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我想活下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.07,1:01:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我也想 瑞安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As do I, Ryan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.81,1:01:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As do we all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.99,1:01:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,但世事难料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But things happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.47,1:01:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,如果当时不是住院医师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were it not for a careless mistake{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.18,1:01:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,粗心大意犯了错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by a resident at the hospital I was in,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.24,1:01:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我的癌症本应该更早被确诊的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my cancer could have been diagnosed a lot sooner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.35,1:02:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,仅仅是因为把X光片的名字弄错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was simply the wrong name on an X-ray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.05,1:02:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,本可以让我少受很多痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would've saved me a whole lot of hardship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.04,1:02:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,还有你 安娜？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you, Anna?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.39,1:02:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我什么也没做 约翰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't do anything, John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.59,1:02:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你了解我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.92,1:02:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托不要这样对我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please don't do this to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.16,1:02:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,安娜和我是邻居\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were neighbors, Anna and I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.37,1:02:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我的第一次化疗过程非常艰难 毫不夸张地说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My first chemo sessions were very difficult, to say the least.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.88,1:02:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,安娜和她的丈夫马修非常善良\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anna and her husband, Matthew, were so kind,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.89,1:02:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,给予了我很多帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so supportive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.23,1:02:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我对此非常感激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thank you for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.65,1:02:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么这样对我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you doing this to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.07,1:02:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那段日子非常美好 不是吗 安娜？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those were better days for you, weren't they, Anna?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.95,1:02:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,但你可怜的丈夫 马修就…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But your poor husband, Matthew...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.17,1:02:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你们两个经常不合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know the two of you didn't always get along.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.79,1:02:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,但不得不忍受孩子的夭折这种悲剧 那真是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But to have to endure that tragedy, the death of a child, that's, uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.96,1:02:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,人生中的大不幸 不是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of life's greatest burdens, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.87,1:02:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,要是那晚他没有睡着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If only he hadn't fallen asleep that night,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.10,1:02:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他就不会翻身压到你们的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then he wouldn't have rolled over and, uh,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.96,1:03:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,使他窒息死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}suffocated your baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.18,1:03:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,事情就是这样 对吗 安娜？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is what happened, right, Anna?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.51,1:03:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.04,1:03:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.77,1:03:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴 闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up. Shut up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.95,1:03:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 真可怕 多么可怕啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, it's horrible. How horrible,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.54,1:03:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,去接受这样一个事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to have to live with such a thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.44,1:03:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,它会让人发疯 不是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It could make a person go mad, couldn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.90,1:03:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你要对我们做什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you going to do to us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.72,1:03:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.61,1:03:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我什么也不会做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not going to do anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.11,1:04:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你们必须要为你们的所作所为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to simply assume responsibility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.66,1:04:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,付出代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.34,1:04:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.34,1:04:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道是这里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know this is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.29,1:04:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,塔克的养猪场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tuck's pig farm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.91,1:04:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这里因为奥耶斯基病毒的爆发被关闭了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was shut down due to an outbreak of aujeszky's disease.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.22,1:04:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,铁桶头的血液样本 猪病毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buckethead's sample. The pig virus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.73,1:04:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这个农场是吉尔·塔克家的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This farm was in Jill Tuck's family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.29,1:04:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,她是竖锯的妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jigsaw's wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.90,1:04:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,现在还归她所有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.25,1:04:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管这地方几年前就关闭了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Although the place was shuttered years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.88,1:04:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,但看起来好像还有人住在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it looks like somebody's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.69,1:04:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定要这么做吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sure you want to do this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.87,1:05:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,哈洛伦 我是亨特 给我回电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Halloran, it's Hunt. Call me back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.55,1:05:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在哈洛伦家里 但他不在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're at halloran's house, but he's not here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.70,1:05:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你找到他的位置了吗？- 正在搜索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You got a location on him? - Searching.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.49,1:05:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,长官？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.96,1:05:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得逮捕他 立刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, we need to bring him in. Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.97,1:06:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,看这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check this out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.79,1:07:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好多血迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a lot of blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.93,1:07:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我敢打赌铁桶头就是在这里被斩首的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's to bet this is where buckethead was decapitated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.00,1:07:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,是竖锯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Jigsaw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.36,1:07:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,竖锯已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jigsaw is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.49,1:07:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.45,1:07:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,求求你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.78,1:07:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你让我做什么都行 约翰 求你放我走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll do anything you want, John, just please let me go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.95,1:07:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.10,1:07:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道猪很有同情心的动物吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you know that pigs are highly compassionate animals?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.57,1:07:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,如果看到其他动物 包括人类受苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They show distress if they see any other animal,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.06,1:07:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,它们就会很悲痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}including humans, suffering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.68,1:07:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,那你呢 约翰？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about you, John?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.23,1:07:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你的同情心在哪儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is your compassion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.71,1:07:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都在同一杆天枰上 安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We all have a thumb on the scale, Anna.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.12,1:07:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,判别善良与罪恶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For good or for evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.18,1:08:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你在罪恶的那一端\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been weighing in on the wrong side of the scale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.63,1:08:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你们俩都是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Both of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.55,1:08:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你们想要自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, if you want to achieve your freedom,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.81,1:08:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你们必须得学习\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you have to learn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.09,1:08:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你们得意识到你们一直都做反了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to realize that you've been doing it backwards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.73,1:08:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,所以…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.21,1:08:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我会给你们一次机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna give you an opportunity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.40,1:08:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,扭转回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to turn it all around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.80,1:08:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你们通往自由之匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's your key to freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.50,1:08:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都取决于你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all up to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.83,1:08:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,游戏很简单 好消息是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, the game's simple. The best ones are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.47,1:08:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你们有一杆枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have one shotgun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.53,1:08:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你们有一颗子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have one shell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.53,1:09:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,正如我说的 一切取决于你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like I said, it's up to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.55,1:09:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么能说竖锯没有死？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can you say Jigsaw isn't dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.93,1:09:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.78,1:09:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,他做过了尸检 还有坟墓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Autopsy was performed on his body and he has his own grave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.08,1:09:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他没有死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.29,1:09:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,竖锯会永生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jigsaw lives forever{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.98,1:09:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,通过他的追随者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}through the work of his followers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.08,1:09:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.44,1:09:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你一开始就痴迷于约翰·克莱默\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been obsessed with John Kramer from the start.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.46,1:09:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那个网站\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The website.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.00,1:09:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你做的陷阱机关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The traps you built.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.90,1:09:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,很多人都痴迷于克莱默\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lots of people are fascinated by Kramer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.38,1:10:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我没有杀死铁桶头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know damn well i didn't kill buckethead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.72,1:10:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,或者另外两个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or the other two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.05,1:10:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是谁干的？- 哈洛伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Then who did? - Halloran.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.57,1:10:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,是你自己说的 子弹吻合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said it yourself. The bullet matches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.11,1:10:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他和所有受害者都有关联\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's connected to all the victims.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.05,1:10:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,他就在你身后 放下武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's right behind you. Drop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.09,1:10:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,放下 你们两个都放下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop it! Both of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.22,1:10:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.34,1:10:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,就是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.55,1:10:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就是他 - 放下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's him! - Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.68,1:10:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不要 不要 - 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't. Don't. - Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.42,1:10:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on! - All right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.82,1:10:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不要 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't. - All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.79,1:10:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 我把它放下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, I'm putting it down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.89,1:10:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,现在该你了 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now it's your turn, sweetheart.{\r}
