Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.46,1:17:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我把无辜的人抓进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I put innocent people away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.19,1:17:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,让杀人犯和强奸犯逍遥法外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Murderers and rapists walked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.53,1:17:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,人们因我而死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People died because of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.80,1:17:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,无辜的人因我而死 是我做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Innocent people died because of me. I did it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.40,1:18:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It fucking can't be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.34,1:18:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.09,1:18:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 嘿…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hey, hey...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.31,1:18:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这…这是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wha... What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.56,1:18:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.65,1:18:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？你他妈在逗我吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Are you fucking kidding me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.30,1:18:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,洛根 你是…什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logan, you're... what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.31,1:18:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？嘿 什么 你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Hey! What, you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.25,1:18:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你和他一伙儿的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're working with him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.21,1:18:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.62,1:18:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.26,1:19:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,在你的一点小帮助下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And with a little help from you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.15,1:19:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人会怀疑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no one will ever suspect it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.01,1:19:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,人们因我而死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People died because of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.26,1:19:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,无辜的人因我而死 是我做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Innocent people died because of me. I did it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.75,1:19:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.69,1:19:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,十年前 就在这个谷仓里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten years ago, in this very barn,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.60,1:19:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,进行了一场游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a game was played.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.54,1:19:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,据说 这个机关是约翰·克莱默\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Supposedly, John Kramer designed this for a game{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.99,1:19:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,在其他那些人之前设计的一个游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that took place before all the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.84,1:19:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,尸体一直还没被发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bodies were never found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.10,1:19:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道这些 因为我是当时的游戏者之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know this because i was one of the players.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.55,1:19:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多十年前 竖锯抓我进了游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jigsaw put me in that game almost 10 years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.56,1:19:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我弄混了他的X光片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mixed up his x-rays.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.72,1:19:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你得割伤自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to cut yourself!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.25,1:20:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰认为我不应为无心之过而付出生命的代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John decided I shouldn't have to die over an honest mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.37,1:20:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,他给了我第二次机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He gave me a second chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.51,1:20:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 十年后的现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So now, 10 years later,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.69,1:20:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我用你错案里的罪犯 重新布置了竖锯的游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've recreated Jigsaw's game with criminals from your failed cases.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.39,1:20:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.41,1:20:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我想让我的游戏和竖锯一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanted my game to be identical to Jigsaw's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.63,1:20:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我翻阅了你办过的案子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I went through your cases.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.67,1:20:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了和原来的游戏里相似的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Found players just like the ones in the original game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.27,1:20:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我给了他们和十年前竖锯所给出的一样的选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gave them the same choices that Jigsaw did a decade ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.57,1:20:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,竖锯的游戏里有五个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jigsaw put five people in his game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.95,1:20:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我选了三个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I put in three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.69,1:20:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你和我就是剩下的两个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and I are the last two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.29,1:20:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我想看看我是否能像他一样伟大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanted to see if i was as worthy as him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.57,1:20:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,一样有天分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As talented.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.83,1:21:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.29,1:21:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样 洛根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Logan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.76,1:21:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 可怜可怜我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Have mercy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.69,1:21:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,像你刚才那样可怜我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like you just had mercy on me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.84,1:21:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你说开始我们的游戏？却按了我的按钮？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you started our game just now? Pushing my button?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.80,1:21:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,救你自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Saving yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.41,1:21:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.64,1:21:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这…这不公平 - 公平？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That... that's not fair! - Fair?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.76,1:21:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么埃德加·曼森被放出来了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why was Edgar Munsen free?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.87,1:21:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个杀人犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was a murderer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.25,1:21:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,但你包庇了他 因为他是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you were protecting him because he was{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.86,1:21:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你多年前的线人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your criminal informant, years ago,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.62,1:21:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你放了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you let him walk free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.66,1:21:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,埃德加·曼森杀了我的妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Edgar Munsen killed my wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.53,1:21:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你不…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.80,1:21:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你不明白 这从没被证实过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know that. It's never been proven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.95,1:21:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这也不能让你的家人活过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This won't bring your family back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.54,1:21:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰·克莱默\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John Kramer,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.28,1:21:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,会给人一个赢下游戏的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}gave people a chance to win the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.41,1:21:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,一个选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.40,1:21:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,操\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.60,1:21:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你这个混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You fucker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.95,1:22:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你有选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.90,1:22:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,喊叫 或者不叫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scream, or don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.04,1:22:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,洛根 洛根 洛根 洛根 嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logan, Logan, Logan. Logan, hey,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.86,1:22:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我能帮你 我能为你做很多事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}look, I can help you. I can do things for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.70,1:22:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你能让我妻子回来吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you bring my wife back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.87,1:22:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我说什么都没用了 对吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't matter what I say, does it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.74,1:22:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我重置了一个竖锯玩过的游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I created a game that appeared to be run by Jigsaw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.33,1:22:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 埃德加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Edgar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.72,1:22:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你将要玩一个游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're about to play a game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.65,1:22:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,有五条人命在你手上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five lives are in your hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.37,1:22:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,按我说的做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow my instructions exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.63,1:22:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我得做出选择 不是他们死就是我死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got to choose who dies, them or me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.90,1:22:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我他妈才不要死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not fucking dying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.58,1:22:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你用什么型号的手枪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of firearm do you use?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.10,1:22:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,格洛克22 大多数警察都用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Glock 22, most cops do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.40,1:22:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,除了哈洛伦 他用格洛克17\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except halloran, he's got a 17.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.38,1:23:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,9x19毫米巴拉贝鲁姆子弹 是格洛克17的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}9x19 parabellum. That's a glock 17.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.95,1:23:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,第一具尸体的指甲里提取到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The blood under the fingernails of our first victim{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.81,1:23:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,是约翰·克莱默的血液\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is John Kramer's blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.92,1:23:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,有人会认为是竖锯做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some will think it's Jigsaw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.10,1:23:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,有人会怀疑你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some will suspect you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.15,1:23:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,但没有人会怀疑我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But no one will suspect me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.57,1:23:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得逮捕他 立刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, we need to bring him in. Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.37,1:23:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,因为埃莉诺会提供我的不在场证明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because Eleanor will provide my alibi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.24,1:23:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.86,1:23:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,十年前 我从战场归来 只有残破的身体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten years ago, I came out of the war a broken man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.20,1:23:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,竖锯重塑了我的人生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jigsaw put the pieces of my life back together again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.29,1:23:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他给了我人生的目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He gave my life purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.15,1:23:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们永远不要沉迷于愤怒或复仇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can never come from anger or from vengeance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.73,1:23:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你教我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You taught me that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.94,1:24:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,但这样就不会有正义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then there will be no justice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.71,1:24:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不 会有的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. But there will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.94,1:24:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我们会为死者发声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because we'll speak for the dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.14,1:24:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一起建造了一个遗产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Together, we built a legacy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.36,1:24:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 我要为那些被你这种人毁掉人生的人发声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I speak for the lives ruined by people like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.56,1:24:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,杀人犯 强奸犯…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Murderers, rapists...{\r}
